WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,700
Take a look

2
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:12,990
There are no ghosts in the world

3
00:00:12,990 --> 00:00:15,030
Our building has been haunted before.

4
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:17,860
The son of the old woman on the first floor died while mining.

5
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:19,700
She waits for her son every day

6
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,900
My uncle next door met her after work

7
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,500
Being pestered and asked where his son was

8
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:24,700
She said she didn't know

9
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,980
Just kept making circles on the stairs

10
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:29,180
She was found in front of her house the next day.

11
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:30,540
Haunted
